  "section": "9.57",
  "rulesText": "Ingested Poison\n\nA creature subjected to Truth Serum must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or have the Poisoned condition for 1 hour. The Poisoned creature can't knowingly communicate a lie."
}
